Error [jet.EffectBoundExceeded]: `rename` uses the effect `DB.Write`, which its signature doesn't allow
  --> Tests/UI/table_put_without_db_write.jet:12:66
    |
 12 | rename: fn(tasks: db.Table<Int, Task>, id: Int, title: String) -[DB.Read]> {
    |                                                                  ^^^^^^^
 Why: The signature declares `-[DB.Read]>`, so the body may only use those; `DB.Write` is outside that set
 Fix: Add `DB.Write` to the effect list, or stop using it in `rename`
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: rename
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0740
